OL,3,GNEWSACrossCountry cancels UK services
OL,4,Aafter power cut
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrains across the UK have been
OL,7,Fcancelled after a power cut at train
OL,8,Foperator CrossCountry's control centre.
OL,10,FThe power outage started in Birmingham
OL,11,Fon Saturday and as a result, many of
OL,12,Fthe systems used to manage the railway
OL,13,Fare unavailable, the operator said.
OL,15,FServices across almost all its routes
OL,16,Fhave been cancelled until further
OL,17,Fnotice as it experiences "significant
OL,18,Fand unforeseen disruption".
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
