OL,3,GNEWSACrossCountry cancels UK services
OL,4,Aafter power cut
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor routes cancelled include services
OL,7,Fbetween Manchester and Birmingham,
OL,8,Fwhich passes through Stoke-on-Trent,
OL,9,FCoventry and Wolverhampton, along with
OL,10,Froutes from Leeds to York, Cheltenham
OL,11,Fto Cardiff and Glasgow to Edinburgh.
